if the vehicle is currently under warranty and, if applicable, whether any additional warranty or service package is available.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Could you please confirm the current selling price and let me know whether the price is negotiable? I would also like to know if there are any additional charges apart from the listed price, such as registration, documentation, transfer, delivery, or other administrative fees.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If possible, please share some recent, high-quality pictures of the exterior, interior, dashboard, tyres, engine compartment, and any visible scratches, dents, or other imperfections. I would prefer to have a clear understanding of the vehicle\'s actual condition before arranging a visit.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Please also let me know the vehicle\'s current location, your available visiting hours, and whether I can schedule an appointment for a physical inspection and test drive. If a test drive is possible, kindly let me know what documents or requirements are needed.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Additionally, please confirm whether financing, leasing, or installment payment options are available. If financing is offered, I would appreciate details regarding the available plans, down payment requirements, interest rates, monthly installments, and applicable terms.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">I am genuinely interested in the vehicle and would be happy to discuss the purchase further once I have the above information. Please feel free to contact me with any additional details, documents, or information that you think would be helpful.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Thank you for your time. I look forward to hearing from you and hope we can proceed with the next steps soon.</p><p>Best regards</p>','system_broadcast','success',NULL,1,1,0,'2026-09-18 12:23:00','2026-09-18 12:23:13',NULL),(2799890,NULL,263,'notification tst','jdhaic sekifwc iuw bfibj cwifgae xuiwhf zudhwfos awe hiufhckxie f<div><br></div>